## education initiative Performance Academy Education Czar status stakeholders Student Services

### Education Czar — A Strategic Coordination Initiative (v2) > Executive Summary
## Executive Summary

This version establishes the Education Czar as a coordination *function*, not a position. It is not a new headcount or budget allocation. It is a formalized coordination framework assigned to an existing team member who serves as the central connector across functional areas.

The function bridges Student Services (Academics, Character/Spiritual Life Formation) and Health & Wellness (Nutrition, Athletic Medicine, Strength and Conditioning, Sport Science, Mental Health), ensuring educational efforts are aligned, monitored, and continuously improved through better communication.

### Education Czar — A Strategic Coordination Initiative (v2) > Defining the Function
## Defining the Function

| Area | Components |
|---|---|
| Student Services | Academics, Character Development, Spiritual Life Formation |
| Health & Wellness | Nutrition, Athletic Medicine, Strength & Conditioning, Sport Science, Mental Health |

What this function IS:

1. A strategic connector creating visibility across all educational programming
2. A bridge facilitating communication and alignment between functional areas
3. A monitor tracking educational deployments and identifying themes
4. A liaison connecting functional areas with B.A.I.R. research opportunities
5. A coordinator helping organize external speaker and thought leader engagements
6. An analyst identifying patterns and informing resource allocation discussions

What this function IS NOT:

- A new position or headcount
- A separate budget or cost center
- A content creator or curriculum developer
- A supervisory role over existing department heads
- A gatekeeper or approval authority for programming
- A replacement for specialized expertise within each area

